      ["Nine full-color concept graphics", "Two Models of Health, Symptoms Are Signals, the Five Tenets, how acute illness becomes chronic, Constitutional Polarities, the Holistic Plant, Taste as Pharmacology, the Forgotten Lineage timeline, and How to Begin. The big ideas, on one page each."],
